{
  // Characters, by what they are.
  //
  // Allies carry a Class. The class provides the basic ability every character of it has; the
  // signature is what makes this Warrior different from that one, and the affinity is what the
  // signature is made of - its damage type and therefore its status effect. The kit is derived
  // from the three, so an ally lists no abilities of its own. Signatures live in
  // SignatureData.json. Design doc 05 §1.
  //
  // An ally that ships with a SignatureId and SignatureAffinity is a STARTER: every new player
  // gets one of each. An ally without them is only a face for the Tavern - the server rolls the
  // signature, affinity and rarity of whoever it puts on it. Most of the allies here are faces,
  // generated by tools/lpc (spec.json -> content.mjs); give one a roll only to make it a starter.
  //
  // Enemies and bosses still list their own abilities: nothing rolls them, so they need no
  // signature. Each carries the Biome it is fought in; a fight draws its waves and its boss from
  // its site's biome, and a biome with none borrows Grassland's.
  //
  // Health is the class's, and grows by HealthGrowthPerLevel a level (design doc 03 §2b).
